window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>'I keep getting drawn back to Collinsport....' </p><p>Fully recovered from her hospital stay and back behind the bar of The Blue Whale, Jessica Griffin welcomes Nate, a stranger in town claiming to be just passing through. </p><p>But how come he knows so much about her, and why is he so keen to lure her back to the house she hasn't set foot in since the death of her husband? </p><p>And he really is so very familiar.... </p><p>Directed by David Darlington and Jim Pierson. </p><p>Nominated for 2016 Scribe Awards Best Audio release. </p>"; 
